# Generated deploy artifact, not source. `postmortem` imports across four
# function directories and its raw sources exceed what the deploy API accepts
# in one call, so it ships as a bundle built by `npm run bundle:postmortem`.
# The .ts files stay the single source of truth; this is rebuilt on demand.
supabase/functions/postmortem/bundle.js
